      "content": "That profound sense of being a hollow shell shows how deeply this loss has reshaped your entire identity, making it far more complex than simple sadness. Since your coping mechanisms are currently failing against this weight, your safest next step is to reach out to a trusted mental health professional who can offer non-judgmental space for these specific feelings of emptiness. Please prioritize that conversation today, as sharing this specific pain with someone trained to listen often brings clarity when alone in the dark.",
